{{!--
  Template: credit-update
  Data keys:
    - name           {string}  Recipient's first name
    - creditChange   {number}  Amount of credits added (+) or deducted (-)
    - creditBalance  {number}  New total credit balance
    - reason         {string}  Human-readable reason for the credit change
    - appUrl         {string}  Base URL of the app
    - unsubscribeToken {string}
    - currentYear    {number}
--}}
<p class="email-greeting">Your credits have been updated, {{name}}</p>

<p>
  We wanted to let you know that your BreathAway credit balance has changed.
</p>

<div class="email-stat-card">
  <p class="email-stat-card__value">
    {{#if (gt creditChange 0)}}+{{/if}}{{creditChange}}
  </p>
  <p class="email-stat-card__label">Credits {{#if (gt creditChange 0)}}Earned{{else}}Used{{/if}}</p>
</div>

{{#if reason}}
<div class="email-highlight-box">
  <p><strong>Reason:</strong> {{reason}}</p>
</div>
{{/if}}

<p>
  Your new balance is <strong>{{creditBalance}} credits</strong>.
  Credits let you unlock premium features and connect with more people on
  BreathAway.
</p>

<div style="text-align: center;">
  <a href="{{appUrl}}/credits" class="email-btn">View My Credits →</a>
</div>

<hr class="email-divider" />

<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #9CA3AF; text-align: center;">
  If you believe this is an error, please
  <a href="{{appUrl}}/help">contact our support team</a>.
</p>
